      "statusChangeNewStatus": "complete",
      "value": "Thank you for the suggestion!\n\nWhen you 'Build & Test' your world, increasing the 'Number of clients' to two or more should allow you to test your world in local multiplayer. \n\nPlease let us know if this feature does not work for you as it should, or if you have any other feedback.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
